        "qwen3-tts-custom-voice",
        "Qwen3-TTS Custom Voice",
        "text-to-speech",
        "",
        "Generate speech locally with Qwen3-TTS 1.7B preset speakers and controllable delivery.",
        "Qwen",
        "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-CustomVoice",
        "The prompt is the exact text to speak. Set language to the target language; voice direction belongs in instruct, not in the spoken text. For long narration, generate sentence or paragraph sections, reuse the same voice, and assemble the audio before generating video. Choose a preset speaker, such as Aiden or Ryan for English. Use instruct for delivery, emotion, and pace."
      ]
